   "t": "html",
   "html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Vac2Go is proud to announce the latest addition to our fleet, the </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/water-trucks/\"><b>Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a versatile, high-capacity water tank truck designed to meet the demands of various industries. Built for efficiency and durability, this new unit offers cutting-edge features that make it an invaluable asset for construction, mining, road maintenance, and other water-intensive projects. With a capacity of 4,000 gallons and a rugged A36 steel construction, this truck is the perfect solution for jobs that require consistent water supply in the toughest conditions.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><b>Introduction to the Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank</b></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/water-trucks/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is designed for performance and durability, with specifications that set it apart in the industry. This tank is constructed from </span><b>A36 steel</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, known for its strength and resilience, ensuring the tank can handle tough job sites and heavy use. Measuring </span><b>198” long, 96” wide, and 64.75” tall</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, the tank features a </span><b>modified ellipse shape</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with large radius corners, maximizing water capacity while minimizing splash and slosh. The </span><b>spray-lined fenders</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> offer extra protection against wear and tear, while the </span><b>rear-mounted ladder</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with anti-slip rungs ensures safety during maintenance and inspections.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Vac2Go, we constantly strive to meet the evolving needs of our clients, which is why we chose to add the Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank to our fleet. This unit was selected for its efficiency, robust design, and versatility, offering a high-quality water solution that our clients can rely on for various applications.</span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><b>Versatility and Key Applications</b></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/water-trucks/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is equipped to handle a wide range of tasks, making it an essential tool across industries. Key applications include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Construction</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Ideal for dust suppression, the truck’s </span><b>4X3 water pump</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and </span><b>independently operated spray valves</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> at the front, mid, and rear of the truck ensure precise water distribution to keep dust levels low, improving air quality and safety.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Mining</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: The tank’s durable design and large capacity make it perfect for dust control and ground stabilization on mining sites, especially in remote or rugged locations.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Road &amp; Bridge</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: The truck’s ability to manage </span><b>on-road water spraying</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> makes it an essential tool for cleaning, compacting, and maintaining roads during construction.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Efficiency and Capacity Advantages</b></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank is built for maximum efficiency, boasting a large water capacity that reduces the need for frequent refills. The truck’s </span><b>50-foot hose reel</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and </span><b>2-1/2” hydrant hose</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> allow for easy water distribution, reducing downtime on site. Its </span><b>3-inch suction hose kit</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, equipped with a </span><b>suction strainer</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, ensures quick and efficient filling, even from creeks or ponds, allowing for continuous operation on extended projects.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This high-capacity design translates into faster job completion and reduced costs, with fewer refills and less time spent transporting water.</span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><b>Ready to Rent? Let’s Connect.</b></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With the addition of the </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/water-trucks/\"><b>Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank</b></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, Vac2Go is ready to meet the most demanding water delivery and management needs. Whether you’re working on a construction site, maintaining roads, or controlling dust and erosion, this unit provides the capacity, durability, and versatility you need to get the job done efficiently.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ready to see how the Load King 4,000 Gallon Water Tank can make your next project more efficient? Call us today at 1-855-VACS2GO or visit our website at </span><a href=\"https://vac2go.com/contact/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">www.vac2go.com/contact</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to reserve this high-capacity water tank truck for your next project. At Vac2Go, we’re committed to providing the right equipment to keep your projects moving forward smoothly.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\" hidden=\"\"><strong style=\"color: #e01f30;\">Industrial Excavation</strong><span style=\"fon